        "headline": "小松機場（KMQ）跑道裂損一度關閉　長榮BR158空中等待後折返桃園",
        "summary": "日本石川縣小松機場（KMQ）今（5）日上午因跑道發現裂損一度全面關閉，造成多架原定抵達航班改降、折返或取消。由臺灣出發的長榮航空BR158也受到影響，班機飛抵日本附近空域後無法降落，在空中等待一段時間後最終放棄前往小松，折返臺灣桃園國際機場（TPE）。",
        "headline_en": "Komatsu Airport (KMQ) Runway Damage Forces Temporary Closure; EVA Air BR158 Holds Before Returning to Taoyuan",
        "summary_en": "Komatsu Airport (KMQ) in Ishikawa Prefecture, Japan, temporarily closed its runway on the morning of October 5 after damage was discovered, forcing several inbound flights to divert, return to their departure airports or be canceled. EVA Air flight BR158 from Taiwan was also affected. After reaching airspace near Komatsu and being unable to land, the aircraft remained airborne for a period before abandoning the approach and returning to Taiwan Taoyuan International Airport (TPE).",
